#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!tkinter.fontchooser` --- Font selection dialog"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:9
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/tkinter/fontchooser.py`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:13
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!tkinter.fontchooser` module provides the :class:`FontChooser` "
"class as an interface to the native font selection dialog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:16
msgid ""
"The font dialog is application-global: there is a single font dialog per Tcl "
"interpreter, and all :class:`FontChooser` instances configure the same "
"dialog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:20
msgid ""
"Depending on the platform, the dialog may be modal or modeless, so :meth:"
"`~FontChooser.show` may return immediately. The selected font is not "
"returned: it is passed as a :class:`~tkinter.font.Font` object to the "
"callback specified with the *command* option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:26
msgid ""
"The dialog also generates two virtual events on the parent window (see the "
"*parent* option):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:29
msgid "``<<TkFontchooserVisibility>>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:30
msgid ""
"Generated when the dialog is shown or hidden. Query the *visible* option to "
"tell which."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:33
msgid "``<<TkFontchooserFontChanged>>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:34
msgid "Generated when the selected font changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:38
msgid ""
"The *command* callback is the only reliable way to obtain the selected font. "
"On some platforms the *font* option is not updated to the user's choice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:43
msgid "The class implementing the font selection dialog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:45
msgid ""
"*master* is the widget whose Tcl interpreter owns the dialog. If omitted, it "
"defaults to *parent* if that is given, or to the default root window "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:49
msgid "The supported configuration options are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:51
msgid ""
"*parent* --- the window to which the dialog and its virtual events are "
"related. It defaults to the main window; on macOS the dialog is shown as a "
"sheet attached to it, rather than as a free-standing panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:55
msgid "*title* --- the title of the dialog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:56
msgid "*font* --- the font that is currently selected in the dialog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:57
msgid ""
"*command* --- a callback that is called with a :class:`~tkinter.font.Font` "
"object wrapping the selected font when the user selects a font."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:60
msgid "*visible* --- whether the dialog is currently displayed (read-only)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:62
msgid ""
"The *font* option accepts the forms supported by :class:`tkinter.font.Font`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:67
msgid ""
"Query or modify the options of the font dialog. With no arguments, return a "
"dict of all option values. With a string argument, return the value of that "
"option. Otherwise, set the given options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:74
msgid "Return the value of the given option of the font dialog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:78
msgid ""
"Display the font dialog. Depending on the platform, this method may return "
"immediately or only once the dialog has been withdrawn."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:84
msgid "Hide the font dialog if it is displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:89
msgid "Module :mod:`tkinter.font`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../library/tkinter.fontchooser.rst:90
msgid "Tkinter font-handling utilities"
msgstr ""
